From: Studio (C1), 2026-11-10 — journey audit JRN-02 and JRN-04, routed to the App session
Subject: [PATCH 011] the "mic is off" card gets a slot of its own; Hello keeps its main button on screen at 360 x 640

JRN-02 (the card ran under the steer chips). The card is AnswerTray's no_mic overlay; StageBody gave it the tiles' height
(answerNeedOf: 152), and its 96 px art + title + line + "Not now" is taller, so "Not now" sat under the chips. Fix: answerNeedOf
returns 160 for tray.overlay === "no_mic" (the stage yields to it, as for the help menu), and on the tiles/pad tray the card
drops its art and tightens its gap and padding (desk.css) so title, line and "Not now" fit in the slot. Layout only.
Measured at class 6 / class 3, Chromium, kaksha dev page fixture=no-mic:
  360x640  before: "Not now" y 458-506, chips y 472-520 (overlap)  after: "Not now" y 404-452, tray 304-464, chips 472-520
  360x720  before: "Not now" y 538-586, chips 552-600             after: "Not now" y 484-532, tray 384-544, chips 552-600
  412x860  after: "Not now" y 604-652, tray 524-684, chips 692
  class 3 (young, no chips) 360x640: "Not now" y 421-485 inside tray 336-496, dock 504

JRN-04 (Hello pushed its next step below the fold). src/ui-v3/kaksha/kit.css, one block under @media (max-height: 740px)
and (max-width: 899px) (single column only): the Hello screen is one viewport high, the card column scrolls inside it, the
card's primary action (.kx-hello-card > .kx-cta or > .kx-hello-pair) is sticky at the foot of the screen, and her face
shrinks (greet min(78vw, 300px, 32dvh); compact never under 184 px so her name and "AI teacher" print whole). No colour, type or
look changed. Taller phones are untouched (412x860 numbers identical before and after).
Measured with the real /c/c1/hello route (mocked /api/me), main button bottom edge, 640 high viewport:
  card      before  after
  greet      619    565   (Tap to hear)
  ai         565    568   (Got it)
  picture    670    608   (That's me)
  likes      575    588   (That's right)
  feel       723    608   (Next)
  hi         479    482
All six are inside 640 and the page no longer scrolls (scrollHeight 640). Same at class 3.
Not done: the classic (non-Kaksha) .hello skin is not touched (reachable only with ?ui=classic).

Checked: tsc -b shows only errors in src/studio-v2/engines/slice.ts, another session's uncommitted file; none in these three.
Tests that read these files pass (r7-app-steer, round3-fix, r7-app-motion, r7-app-identity, r7-app-audit-batch3,
